# held/props/handbells: a pair of brass hand bells for the Flute posture's Bells variant (PROPS, P2b), one in each hand,
# rung high and low in turn (hold, raise). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Anchored on the right shoulder, hung under the
# fists (the left hand's bell at the left grip).
